OL,5,G2200 A&E After Dark
OL,6,     FDoctors have minutes to save a
OL,7,     Fman's sight in East London after a
OL,8,     Fviolent attack, while in Belfast
OL,9,     Furgent tests assess an elderly
OL,10,     Ffarmer with suspected
OL,11,     Flife-threatening abdominal pain.
OL,12,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,13,     FDr Natalia Spierings struggles to
OL,14,     Fsee acne hidden with makeup by a
OL,15,     Fpatient. Dr Toby Nelson is shocked
OL,16,     Fby a patient's DIY attempt on a
OL,17,     Fcyst. Dr Adil Sheraz tackles a
OL,18,     Fstubborn lipoma.
