OL,12,G0250 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,13,     FTwo critically ill children are
OL,14,     Frushed in by ambulance within ten
OL,15,     Fminutes of each other.
OL,16,     FTen-year-old Kai has been having
OL,17,     Fseizures, and 18-month-old Joel is
OL,18,     Fstruggling to breathe.
